  "conclusion": "At the finite-beta stress radius the correction has the right sign but its amplitude does not match the Redl target. The finite-Pmax trend is not yet a quadrature-stable convergence claim, and the default reduced closure remains above the 1e-1 current gate. The stress-radius current is also a cancellation-dominated species-current observable, so small species-flow imbalances are amplified in the net current.",
